{"id":"e7bde29df78fed04","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem.md","title":"Sobolev Embedding Regimes","display":"df-sobolev-embedding-theorem — Sobolev Embedding Regimes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem","aliases":["58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem"],"display":"df-sobolev-embedding-theorem — Sobolev Embedding Regimes","depends_on":["[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","[[58-df-function-space]]","[[../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sobolev-embedding-theorem — Sobolev Embedding Regimes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ddc0c5d640e9ab2\" href=\"?note=3ddc0c5d640e9ab2\" title=\"58-df-function-space\">58-df-function-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e5a0510b115e1b59\" href=\"?note=e5a0510b115e1b59\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le p&lt;\\infty\">\\(1\\le p&lt;\\infty\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> (Sobolev space, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"58-df-sobolev-space\">58-df-sobolev-space</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S(X,Y,N_X,N_Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S(X,Y,N_X,N_Y)\\)</span> (norm-explicit continuous-inclusion predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (Sobolev-embedding predicate defined in this file)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (Morrey-embedding predicate defined in this file)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 及其范数使用 <code>58-df-sobolev-space</code> 的实值 a.e. 商类空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q(\\mathbb R^n)=L^q(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\">\\(L^q(\\mathbb R^n)=L^q(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\\)</span>，其中 Borel 数据取同一依赖链中的欧氏数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^q}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^q}\\)</span> 分别缩写这些载体上的范数函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{0,\\alpha}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(C^{0,\\alpha}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-holder-function-space</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega=\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 的实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\)</span> 为其定义域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>此处保留原四参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,q)\">\\(\\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,q)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,\\alpha)\\)</span>，不同于 <code>58-df-sobolev-embedding</code> 中的二参数接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\)</span> 仍严格按集合包含定义，不隐含代表元映射或其他嵌入函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S(X,Y,N_X,N_Y)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y\\land N_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\land N_Y\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{Y}\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall f\\in X\\;\\bigl(N_Y(f)\\leq C\\,N_X(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S(X,Y,N_X,N_Y)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y\\land N_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\land N_Y\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{Y}\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall f\\in X\\;\\bigl(N_Y(f)\\leq C\\,N_X(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,q)\\leftrightarrow k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1\\le p&lt;\\frac nk\\land q=\\frac{np}{n-kp}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n),\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}},\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^q}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,q)\\leftrightarrow k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1\\le p&lt;\\frac nk\\land q=\\frac{np}{n-kp}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n),\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}},\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^q}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morrey\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}regime} \\vdash \\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1\\le p&lt;\\infty\\land\\alpha=k-\\frac np\\land0&lt;\\alpha&lt;1\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\mathbb R^n),\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}},\\|\\cdot\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morrey\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}regime} \\vdash \\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1\\le p&lt;\\infty\\land\\alpha=k-\\frac np\\land0&lt;\\alpha&lt;1\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\mathbb R^n),\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}},\\|\\cdot\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>At the critical case <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{1,n}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(W^{1,n}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> embeds into every finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q\">\\(L^q\\)</span> only with the appropriate lower-order control; Moser–Trudinger gives an exponential-integrability substitute for the missing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^\\infty\">\\(L^\\infty\\)</span> endpoint on bounded domains.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The trace theorem maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{s,p}(\\mathbb R^n_+)\">\\(W^{s,p}(\\mathbb R^n_+)\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{s-1/p,p}(\\mathbb R^{n-1})\">\\(W^{s-1/p,p}(\\mathbb R^{n-1})\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;1/p\">\\(s&gt;1/p\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The subcritical embedding on all of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> is not compact because translations destroy compactness.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Rellich–Kondrachov supplies compact subcritical embeddings on suitable bounded domains.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件的集合包含条件与规范代表元关系不是同一个条件。因前者已是明确的形式定义，本次不因其非标准而替换原谓词；其真假不能从另一接口的嵌入定理直接转移。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sobolev-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function-space","status":"resolved","id":"3ddc0c5d640e9ab2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sobolev-space","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)$ (Sobolev space, see [[58-df-sobolev-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le p<\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S(X,Y,N_X,N_Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"L^q(\\mathbb R^n)=L^q(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^q}","display":false},{"tex":"C^{0,\\alpha}(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega=\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S(X,Y,N_X,N_Y)\\leftrightarrow X\\subseteq Y\\land N_X\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{X}\\land N_Y\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{Y}\\land\\exists C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall f\\in X\\;\\bigl(N_Y(f)\\leq C\\,N_X(f)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}theorem} \\vdash \\operatorname{SobolevEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,q)\\leftrightarrow k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1\\le p<\\frac nk\\land q=\\frac{np}{n-kp}\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n),\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}},\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^q}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}morrey\\text{-}embedding\\text{-}regime} \\vdash \\operatorname{MorreyEmbedding}_S(k,p,n,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow k,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1\\le p<\\infty\\land\\alpha=k-\\frac np\\land0<\\alpha<1\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{k,p}(\\mathbb R^n),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\mathbb R^n),\\|\\cdot\\|_{W^{k,p}},\\|\\cdot\\|_{C^{0,\\alpha}}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"W^{1,n}(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"L^q","display":false},{"tex":"L^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"W^{s,p}(\\mathbb R^n_+)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{s-1/p,p}(\\mathbb R^{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"s>1/p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n","display":false}],"bytes":3386,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem.md|58-df-sobolev-embedding-theorem]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","3ddc0c5d640e9ab2","e5a0510b115e1b59","a1d034d5d39b4a14"]}